      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm not sure I follow the goblin comparison, I was looking for more of the actual science behind it. Can you explain the specific metabolic relationship between the Lactobacillus and the yeast when the temperature spikes? Like, how does the heat affect the production of lactic vs acetic acid in this context?",
